      "account": "Retries shift the same local path by fixed 1 cm offsets and then choose the nearest waypoint from the already-failed state. For effects with one retained template, all four attempts keep template rank zero. Failed grasp traces terminate in middle/late waypoints without a forced pre-grasp reset; videos show persistent miss states.",
